<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Research | IPD Lab</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/en/category/research/</link><atom:link href="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/en/category/research/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>本实验室面向大模型和智能体应用、弱光视觉增强、深度估计与人体动作识别，开展感知前端与自主决策相关研究。</description><generator>Hugo Blox Builder (https://hugoblox.com)</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/media/icon_hu_60ce1059faf1d6a9.png</url><title>Research</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/en/category/research/</link></image><item><title>Enhance-Then-Deblur Accepted at ACM MM 2026</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/en/blog/2026-acm-mm-enhance-then-deblur/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/en/blog/2026-acm-mm-enhance-then-deblur/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;From November 10–14, 2026, ACM Multimedia 2026 was held in Rio de Janeiro. Our paper “Enhance-Then-Deblur: Revealing the Sequential Inductive Bias in Joint Low-Light Image Enhancement and Deblurring” was accepted and published.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="authors"&gt;Authors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guangbin Zhou (Ph.D. student / first author), Zhaolin Xiao (advisor / corresponding author), Wengai Li, Haonan Su, and Lifeng He (Aichi Prefectural University).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="key-finding"&gt;Key finding&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joint low-light detail enhancement and deblurring exhibits a Sequential Inductive Bias: enhance-then-deblur is theoretically preferable to deblur-then-enhance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
