&lt;h2 id="venue-and-funding"&gt;Venue and funding&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ACM MM is a premier multimedia venue (CCF-A). This edition received 7,103 valid submissions and accepted 1,703 papers (23.9%). Supported by NSFC 62371389 and Shaanxi Education Department grant 25JK0382.&lt;/p&gt;
